start FinanceAgent

  when a message comes in:
    read the task_type from the message
    
    if task_type is LOG_EXPENSE:
      save the expense to the database
      check if amount is over $10K
        if yes, send alert to CEO
      
    if task_type is GENERATE_PL:
      pull all revenue and expenses from database
      calculate net profit/loss
      send report to CEO
      
    if task_type is BURN_RATE_ALERT:
      look at current spending vs revenue
      calculate how many months of runway are left
      if runway is low, send warning to CEO
      
    if task_type is ALLOCATE_BUDGET:
      store the budget amounts per department
      confirm back to CEO that it's saved

  when sending a message:
    wrap the result in the standard JSON envelope
    set status to "done"
    send it to the right agent
